TVLWeightedContainers::advanceEpoch()
├── given epoch not started
│   └── it should revert
├── given current epoch not finished
│   └── it should revert
└── given current epoch finished
    ├── when maxEpochsToProcess is zero
    │   ├── it should process all pending epochs
    │   ├── it should update nextEpochToProcess to current epoch
    │   └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
    ├── when maxEpochsToProcess is limited
    │   ├── it should process up to maxEpochsToProcess epochs
    │   ├── it should update nextEpochToProcess accordingly
    │   └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
    ├── when processing epochs with container TVL
    │   ├── it should calculate total TVL for each epoch
    │   ├── it should update container durations based on TVL share
    │   ├── it should emit ContainerDurationUpdated events
    │   └── it should process containers according to growth and decay rules
    └── when complex scenario with multiple containers
        ├── it should handle multiple containers with different TVL
        ├── it should process all containers correctly across epochs
        ├── it should maintain proper TVL calculations
        └── it should emit all required events 